---
/**
 * DtsShowcase — the three design directions for dreamtravelstudy.com,
 * rendered with Tania's REAL directory, fetched live in the visitor's browser
 * from her own open WordPress REST API (which allows cross-origin reads).
 *
 * Nothing of hers is committed to this public repo: the markup below holds
 * only post IDs and neutral placeholder text. If her site is unreachable when
 * the page is opened, the placeholders stay — composed layouts with neutral
 * labels, never a broken one.
 *
 * The three directions are deliberately three different ideas of what the
 * site IS: a warm prospectus, a precise reference instrument, an editorial
 * travel journal. Different type, different structure, different logic.
 */
